    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/32b3dc37ad9c8793ef33199c10a09d1a.webp?t=1709634622\" width=600 height=46 /></span><br>~ A roguelite deckbuilder with elements of shoot 'em up where you should tactically think about which spells and upgrades suit your game style best.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/c07180883a6bd939c84a7330e1313d3d.poster.avif?t=1709634622\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/c07180883a6bd939c84a7330e1313d3d.webm?t=1709634622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/c07180883a6bd939c84a7330e1313d3d.mp4?t=1709634622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/bac153e202cad58ba0948d52df3dc9ea.webp?t=1709634622\" width=600 height=12 /></span><br>~ Encounter a variety of enemies, each with their unique mechanics.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/599ca5503b69c59fa377a2a98c5a01ff.poster.avif?t=1709634622\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/599ca5503b69c59fa377a2a98c5a01ff.webm?t=1709634622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/599ca5503b69c59fa377a2a98c5a01ff.mp4?t=1709634622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/bac153e202cad58ba0948d52df3dc9ea.webp?t=1709634622\" width=600 height=12 /></span><br>~ Gain experience to obtain summoning folios, which can rescue your magic robe when everything goes from bad to worse.<br>~ Intuitive mechanics, without any tutorials.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/ae6d4e01a8cec0bfbaf83bc160f6992d.poster.avif?t=1709634622\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/ae6d4e01a8cec0bfbaf83bc160f6992d.webm?t=1709634622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/ae6d4e01a8cec0bfbaf83bc160f6992d.mp4?t=1709634622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/bac153e202cad58ba0948d52df3dc9ea.webp?t=1709634622\" width=600 height=12 /></span><br>~ Engage in quests with bosses to prevent boredom.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/d5f442a57f135713a3e010cba00ffe8a.poster.avif?t=1709634622\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/d5f442a57f135713a3e010cba00ffe8a.webm?t=1709634622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846430/extras/d5f442a57f135713a3e010cba00ffe8a.mp4?t=1709634622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
